        "original_id": "6f43afac-d93b-59da-b056-48ef7aa8a696",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Governments: 2nd Rama Government, 2nd Cabinet of Prime Minister Edi Rama\n- People: Edi Rama\n- Roles: Prime Minister of Albania\n- Places: Albania, Republic of Albania\n\nFacts:\n- The 2nd Cabinet of Prime Minister Edi Rama is the 9th Cabinet of the Republic of Albania.\n- The 2nd Cabinet of Prime Minister Edi Rama was to be officially mandated by the President in September 2017.\n- The Prime Minister of Albania is officially styled the Prime Minister of the Republic of Albania.\n- The Prime Minister of Albania is the head of government of Albania.\n- The Prime Minister of Albania is described as the most powerful and influential person in Albanian politics.",
